===== 1. Authentication rules of the temporary server (pg_hba.conf, comments removed) =====
local   all             all                                     scram-sha-256
host    all             all             127.0.0.1/32            scram-sha-256
host    all             all             ::1/128                 scram-sha-256
local   replication     all                                     scram-sha-256
host    replication     all             127.0.0.1/32            scram-sha-256
host    replication     all             ::1/128                 scram-sha-256

===== Roles: r2_analyst may log in; r2_support has a password but NOLOGIN; passwords stored as SCRAM verifiers =====
  rolname   | rolcanlogin | rolsuper | stored_password_format 
------------+-------------+----------+------------------------
 r2_analyst | t           | f        | SCRAM-SHA-256
 r2_support | f           | f        | SCRAM-SHA-256
(2 rows)


===== 2. No password =====
>>> EXPECTED CONNECTION RESULT [2]: no password supplied -> refused
psql: error: connection to server at "127.0.0.1", port 55217 failed: fe_sendauth: no password supplied
<<< psql exit code: 2

===== 3. Wrong password =====
>>> EXPECTED CONNECTION RESULT [2]: wrong password -> FATAL password authentication failed
psql: error: connection to server at "127.0.0.1", port 55217 failed: FATAL:  password authentication failed for user "r2_analyst"
<<< psql exit code: 2

===== 4. Correct password, but the role is NOLOGIN =====
>>> EXPECTED CONNECTION RESULT [2]: r2_support (NOLOGIN) -> FATAL role is not permitted to log in
psql: error: connection to server at "127.0.0.1", port 55217 failed: FATAL:  role "r2_support" is not permitted to log in
<<< psql exit code: 2

===== 5. Correct password: authenticated restricted session, then forbidden operations =====
>>> EXPECTED CONNECTION RESULT [0]: r2_analyst with the correct password -> session opens; probe runs
===== Who is connected, and how was the connection authenticated? =====
SELECT session_user, current_user, system_user AS authenticated_as,
       (SELECT rolsuper FROM pg_roles WHERE rolname = current_user) AS is_superuser;
 session_user | current_user |     authenticated_as     | is_superuser 
--------------+--------------+--------------------------+--------------
 r2_analyst   | r2_analyst   | scram-sha-256:r2_analyst | f
(1 row)

===== Allowed: the aggregated view (no user data in it) =====
SELECT symbol, ticks, alerts FROM review2.v_instrument_activity ORDER BY symbol;
  symbol  | ticks | alerts 
----------+-------+--------
 BTCUSDT  |     8 |      2
 ETHUSDT  |     2 |      1
 HDFCBANK |     0 |      0
 INFY     |     2 |      0
 M&M      |     0 |      0
 RELIANCE |    12 |      3
 TCS      |     6 |      2
(7 rows)

